cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CubatureRules.jl, please cite it as below. For the references of one rule, use cite(rule)."
type: software
title: "CubatureRules.jl: quadrature and cubature rules computed on demand, at any degree and precision"
abstract: >-
  Quadrature and cubature rules computed on demand, for any polynomial degree and at any
  precision, on intervals, simplices, boxes, spheres, balls, wedges, pyramids and unbounded
  domains. Fully symmetric rules come from tables that the package's own searches produced,
  and every rule carries a certificate of its construction and can be verified independently.
authors:
